 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Timna bore a son to Eliphaz",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the land of Edom he became chief",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Descended from Esau and Adah",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Amalek rose in the desert wild",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A tribal leader of the old line",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Rooted in the history of the soil",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blot out the memory from under heaven",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD declared a war for ages",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Remember what was done along the way",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their name shall fade in God\u2019s judgment",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At Rephidim they attacked from behind",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Striking the weary and the worn out",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Moses stood on the hill with the staff",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Joshua fought with the edge of the sword",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Aaron and Hur held his hands up",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Until the sunset brought the victory",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blot out the memory from under heaven",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD declared a war for ages",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Remember what was done along the way",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their name shall fade in God\u2019s judgment",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Samuel spoke to Saul the king",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Strike them down and spare nothing at all",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Man and woman and child and beast",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Saul kept Agag and the best",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He turned away from the command",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the LORD regretted making him king",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blot out the memory from under heaven",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
